    "body": "Oh, I see, we can't move the map/set steps under map/set because we need to add the element to the memory map first. That's a bit sad.\n\nWhile you're here do you want to consistify `Record {[[Key]]` vs. `Record { [[Key]]`? It looks like per recent ES discussions `Record { [[Key]]` is the direction people are going.\n\nLGTM with that nit though.\n",
